        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Alternate title: Data never lies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bright Moonâ€™s judiciary system needs to be re-examined.  So do the assumptions of some the Princesses.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
